= The 2018 Midterms

The time has come. Our performance in this election may decide the future of American democracy. 

For many, failure is not an option.

We have 2 separate sets of results to see. Let's start with the Senate

- @senate: The Senate Results

@senate
face-image = senate_results_1.png

A disappointing result. Even though we won the national popular vote, the Republicans have made off with 2 of our seats, leaving them with a 53 seat majority.

Maybe our numerous House campaigns will bring us some better news?

- @house: The House Results

@house
face-image: house_results_1.png

The House presents us with a much better situation. We have managed to steal 41 seats, giving us the majority in the lower house of Congress.

Now comes the question of leadership.
